  "title": "出海技术栈集成教程（八）：Cloudflare Turnstile 人机检测",
  "author": "程普",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lvso3ci20g_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "出海技术栈教程",
    "Cloudflare",
    "出海技术栈集成教程"
  ],
  "content": "<div>大家好，我是程普，我整理了 Nexty.dev 模板通用配置的文档，以专栏形式发不到哥飞社群网站，希望能帮助到大家。</div>\n<div>专栏内容包含如下主题：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/7uv23xnpvu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">域名购买、解析与配置</a></li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/fkw7vhixs0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Supabase 集成教程</a>：登录与数据库</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/hqxgijh2i1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stripe 集成教程</a>：支付配置与开发</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/8laqxlge8d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Resend 集成教程</a>：邮件服务</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/dtoh6wu12z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">域名邮箱配置教程</a>：收发邮件都能用域名邮箱</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/m3sh3t8l5f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Upstash 集成教程</a>：Redis 与限流器</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/1jr11qls7e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cloudflare R2集成教程</a>：免费图片存储</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/lvso3ci20g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cloudflare Turnstile集成教程</a>：免费人机检测</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<div><a href=\"https://nexty.dev/?ref=gefei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nexty</a> 向哥飞社群提供骨折价，想购买的朋友加我微信（bigye_chengpu）获取专属优惠码再下单。</div>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div>Cloudflare Turnstile 是由 Cloudflare 提供的免费人机验证解决方案，具有用户体验友好、非侵入式挑战等特点，能够有效识别和阻止恶意机器人。</div>\n<div>当你的 SaaS 产品用户逐渐增加的时候，防范自动化机器人和恶意行为。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">集成步骤</h2>\n<div>由于 Nexty 目前的版本是基于 Supabase 的 Auth，所以本章是介绍 Cloudflare Turnstile 的创建与 Supabase Auth 中的配置。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">Cloudfalre 创建 Turnstile Widget</h3>\n<div>登录 Cloudflare，打开左侧目录 Turnstile，点击 <code>Add Widget</code></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lvso3ci20g_img1.png\" alt=\"add-widget.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>选择生产环境域名，并手动输入 localhost，后者用于本地测试</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lvso3ci20g_img2.png\" alt=\"add-hostnames.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>选择 Widget Mode 和 pre-clearance</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lvso3ci20g_img3.png\" alt=\"select-mode.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><code>Widget Mode</code> 决定了通过什么方式来判断访客是不是机器人，3个选项含义分别是：</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Managed（推荐）</strong>：智能分析访客行为，可信用户直接通过，可疑用户需要点击验证</li>\n<li><strong>Non-interactive</strong>：显示加载动画，后台自动完成验证，用户无需操作</li>\n<li><strong>Invisible</strong>：完全隐藏验证过程，后台静默完成所有检查</li>\n</ul>\n<div><code>Would you like to opt for pre-clearance for this site?</code> 是决定已验证用户在后续访问中是否可以跳过部分验证流程。</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>选择 No</strong>：每次访问都需要完整验证</li>\n<li><strong>选择 Yes</strong>：根据所选模式提供不同程度的验证豁免</li>\n</ul>\n<div>创建完成后，你会获得 Site Key 和 Secret Key。Site Key 用于前端集成，需加入环境变量 <code>NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY</code>。Secret Key 用于后端验证，将在下一步使用。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lvso3ci20g_img4.png\" alt=\"turnstile-key.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">Supabase 开启 Attack Protection</h3>\n<div>打开 Supabase - Authentication - Attack Protection，将 Secret Key 填到 Captcha secret 输入框</div>\n<div><img src=\"/assets/integration/turnstile/supabase-attack-protection.png\" alt=\"supabase-attack-protection\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">代码集成</h3>\n<div>Nexty 在邮箱登录流程中预集成了 Cloudflare Turnstile，你只需要配置环境变量即可使用。</div>\n<div>在 Nexty 的代码中，你可以在登录页代码看到下列相关代码：</div>\n<ol>\n<li>导入 Turnstile 组件</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-ts\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">import</span><span> </span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span class=\"token imports\"> </span><span class=\"token imports maybe-class-name\">Turnstile</span><span class=\"token imports\"> </span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span> </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">from</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'@marsidev/react-turnstile'</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>创建 state</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-ts\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">const</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>captchaToken</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> setCaptchaToken</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> </span><span class=\"token generic-function\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">useState</span><span class=\"token generic-function generic\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token generic-function generic\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">string</span><span class=\"token generic-function generic\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\"> </span><span class=\"token generic-function generic\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">|</span><span class=\"token generic-function generic\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\"> </span><span class=\"token generic-function generic nil\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">undefined</span><span class=\"token generic-function generic\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>渲染验证组件，并提供 <code>onSuccess</code> 属性作为成功回调</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-tsx\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>process</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">env</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&amp;&amp;</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">Turnstile</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\n</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">siteKey</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript script-punctuation\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">=</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">process</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript property-access\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">env</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\n</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">onSuccess</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript script-punctuation\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">=</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">token</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\"> </span><span class=\"token script language-javascript arrow\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\"> </span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\n</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">      </span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">setCaptchaToken</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">token</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\n</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">    </span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\n</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">/&gt;</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">验证效果</h2>\n<div>配置完成后，用户在进行邮箱登录时将自动触发 Turnstile 验证，有效防范机器人攻击，提升网站安全性。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lvso3ci20g_img6.png\" alt=\"turnstile-demo.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
